OL,3,GNEWSAWoman with nine brain tumours
OL,4,Abacks funding call
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman diagnosed with nine brain
OL,7,Ftumours after becoming confused during
OL,8,Fa work meeting has backed a charity's
OL,9,Fcall for more money to be put into
OL,10,Fresearch.
OL,12,FLaura Critchley, from Swinton,
OL,13,Funderwent surgery to remove five
OL,14,Fgrowths, but doctors said four were
OL,15,Finoperable and predicted more were
OL,16,Flikely to appear.
OL,18,FThe 40-year-old mother-of-two is
OL,19,Fsupporting Brain Tumour Research's
OL,20,Fappeal for an increase in national
OL,21,Finvestment into research to at least
OL,22,F#45m a year by 2029.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
