OL,3,GNEWSAWoman with nine brain tumours
OL,4,Abacks funding call
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Department of Health and Social
OL,7,FCare said its new National Cancer Plan
OL,8,Fwould work to provide faster access to
OL,9,Fclinical trials and develop innovations
OL,10,Fsuch as the rapid brain tumour test to
OL,11,F"transform treatment" for patients.
